# Build-context filter for the identity sidecar image (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Context is the apps/ monorepo root; ship only the nmem-identity source + the entrypoint.
*
!nmem-identity
!nmem/docker/studio/identity-entrypoint.sh

# prune heavy / irrelevant bits
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/node_modules
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
nmem-identity/tests
